{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"جمل أطول ومفردات أقلّ شيوعًا. الكلمات الجديدة في معظمها مشروحة أدناه."},{"btype":"example","text":"Yanni wants to understand.","note":"يانّي يريد أن يفهم."},{"btype":"example","text":"Does he understand Italian?","note":"هل يفهم الإيطالية؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"You have to understand that.","note":"عليك أن تفهم ذلك."},{"btype":"example","text":"I don't understand anything.","note":"لا أفهم شيئاً."},{"btype":"example","text":"One day, you will understand.","note":"ستفهم ذلك يوما ما."},{"btype":"example","text":"Yanni doesn't understand Rima.","note":"ياني لا يفهم ريمة."},{"btype":"example","text":"He didn't understand anything.","note":"لم يفهم شيئا."},{"btype":"example","text":"I don't want you to understand.","note":"لا أريدك أن تفهم."},{"btype":"example","text":"Even children can understand it.","note":"حتى الأطفال يمكنهم فهم ذلك."},{"btype":"example","text":"I did not understand him at all.","note":"لم أفهمه على الإطلاق."},{"btype":"example","text":"I don't understand a thing here.","note":"لا أفهم شيئا مما يجري هنا."},{"btype":"example","text":"Ziri will never understand this.","note":"لن يفهم زيري هذا أبدا."}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":6,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.dictation","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"en","lang_name":"الإنجليزية","sentences":[{"t":"Yanni wants to understand.","ar":"يانّي يريد أن يفهم."},{"t":"Does he understand Italian?","ar":"هل يفهم الإيطالية؟"},{"t":"You have to understand that.","ar":"عليك أن تفهم ذلك."},{"t":"I don't understand anything.","ar":"لا أفهم شيئاً."},{"t":"One day, you will understand.","ar":"ستفهم ذلك يوما ما."},{"t":"Yanni doesn't understand Rima.","ar":"ياني لا يفهم ريمة."},{"t":"He didn't understand anything.","ar":"لم يفهم شيئا."},{"t":"I don't want you to understand.","ar":"لا أريدك أن تفهم."},{"t":"Even children can understand it.","ar":"حتى الأطفال يمكنهم فهم ذلك."},{"t":"I did not understand him at all.","ar":"لم أفهمه على الإطلاق."},{"t":"I don't understand a thing here.","ar":"لا أفهم شيئا مما يجري هنا."},{"t":"Ziri will never understand this.","ar":"لن يفهم زيري هذا أبدا."},{"t":"Ziri didn't understand anything.","ar":"لم يفهم زيري شيئا."},{"t":"I won't be able to understand it.","ar":"لن أقدر على فهمه."},{"t":"Yanni didn't understand at first.","ar":"في بداية الأمر، لم يفهم ياني."},{"t":"Ziri doesn't understand anything.","ar":"زيري لا يفهم شيئا."},{"t":"He won't be able to understand it.","ar":"لن يتمكّن من فهمه."},{"t":"Ziri, I don't think you understand.","ar":"لا أظنك تفهم يا زيري."},{"t":"I think Tom can't understand French.","ar":"أظن بأن توم لا يفهم الفرنسية."},{"t":"I don't believe she would understand.","ar":"لا أعتقد أنها ستفهم."},{"t":"Tom isn't old enough to understand this.","ar":"توم ليس كبيراً بما يكفي ليفهم هذا."},{"t":"You have to understand that I have to go now.","ar":"ينبغي أن تفهم أنه عليّ الذهاب الآن."},{"t":"Let us know if you don't understand something.","ar":"اخبرنا عندما لم تفهم شيئا ما."},{"t":"\"Do you understand?\" \"I don't understand at all.\"","ar":"\"هل فهمت؟\" \"لم أفهم بتاتا.\""},{"t":"I've done my best.","ar":"بذلت قصارى جهدي."},{"t":"Ziri did his best.","ar":"بذل زيري قصارى جهده."},{"t":"You must do your best.","ar":"عليك أن تفعل ما بوسعك."},{"t":"Ziri will do his best.","ar":"سيبذل زيري كل ما بوسعه."},{"t":"Our friends are the best.","ar":"أصدقاؤنا هم الأفصل."},{"t":"Do your best in everything.","ar":"ابذل وسعك في كل شيء ."}],"focus":[],"difficulty":5}}